an><span begin="00:24.792" end="00:25.429">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.021" end="00:28.443"><span begin="00:26.021" end="00:26.224">So </span><span begin="00:26.224" end="00:26.413">we </span><span begin="00:26.413" end="00:26.658">could </span><span begin="00:26.658" end="00:27.098">drift </span><span begin="00:27.098" end="00:28.443">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.807" end="00:30.197"><span begin="00:28.807" end="00:30.197">Mhm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.738" end="00:36.445"><span begin="00:30.738" end="00:30.938">But </span><span begin="00:30.938" end="00:31.128">in </span><span begin="00:31.128" end="00:33.621">reality </span><span begin="00:33.947" end="00:34.165">I </span><span begin="00:34.165" end="00:34.487">wish </span><span begin="00:34.487" end="00:35.013">that </span><span begin="00:35.013" end="00:36.445">possibly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.556" end="00:37.460"><span begin="00:36.556" end="00:37.460">Possibly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.594" end="00:44.061"><span begin="00:37.594" end="00:37.823">That </span><span begin="00:37.823" end="00:38.416">someone </span><span begin="00:38.416" end="00:38.817">could </span><span begin="00:38.817" end="00:39.538">find </span><span begin="00:39.538" end="00:39.916">their </span><span begin="00:39.916" end="00:41.253">way </span><span begin="00:41.836" end="00:42.220">to </span><span begin="00:42.220" end="00:42.999">my </span><span begin="00:42.999" end="00:44.061">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.162" end="00:52.707"><span begin="00:46.162" end="00:46.358">Oh </span><span begin="00:46.358" end="00:47.138">I </span><span begin="00:47.138" end="00:48.097">long </span><span begin="00:48.097" end="00:48.979">for </span><span begin="00:48.979" end="00:50.931">someone </span><span begin="00:50.931" end="00:51.734">who </span><span begin="00:51.734" end="00:52.707">stays</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.063" end="00:58.603"><span begin="00:53.063" end="00:53.731">Even </span><span begin="00:53.731" end="00:54.582">if </span><span begin="00:54.582" end="00:55.763">the </span><span begin="00:55.763" end="00:56.494">world </span><span begin="00:56.494" end="00:57.376">crashes </span><span begin="00:57.376" end="00:58.603">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.326" end="01:02.193"><span begin="01:00.326" end="01:00.539">But </span><span begin="01:00.539" end="01:00.758">when </span><span begin="01:00.758" end="01:00.971">you </span><span begin="01:00.971" end="01:01.596">walked </span><span begin="01:01.596" end="01:02.193">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.371" end="01:06.774"><span begin="01:04.371" end="01:04.579">No </span><span begin="01:04.579" end="01:04.758">more </span><span begin="01:04.758" end="01:05.921">cloudy </span><span begin="01:05.921" end="01:06.774">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.331" end="01:09.711"><span begin="01:07.331" end="01:07.534">I </span><span begin="01:07.534" end="01:07.742">feel </span><span begin="01:07.742" end="01:07.945">it </span><span begin="01:07.945" end="01:08.126">in </span><span begin="01:08.126" end="01:08.944">my </span><span begin="01:08.944" end="01:09.711">skin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.486" end="01:14.246"><span begin="01:11.486" end="01:11.657">I'm </span><span begin="01:11.657" end="01:12.169">guessin' </span><span begin="01:12.169" end="01:12.342">that </span><span begin="01:12.342" end="01:12.747">you </span><span begin="01:12.747" end="01:13.273">found </span><span begin="01:13.273" end="01:13.634">your </span><span begin="01:13.634" end="01:14.246">way?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.632" end="01:18.670"><span begin="01:15.632" end="01:15.845">Oh </span><span begin="01:15.845" end="01:16.027">you </span><span begin="01:16.027" end="01:16.827">hit </span><span begin="01:16.827" end="01:17.112">me </span><span begin="01:17.112" end="01:17.561">like </span><span begin="01:17.561" end="01:17.859">a </span><span begin="01:17.859" end="01:18.670">truck</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.400" end="01:24.200"><span begin="01:19.400" end="01:19.606">But </span><span begin="01:19.606" end="01:19.803">now </span><span begin="01:19.803" end="01:20.025">the </span><span begin="01:20.025" end="01:20.559">sun </span><span begin="01:20.559" end="01:21.471">shines </span><span begin="01:21.471" end="01:22.447">above </span><span begin="01:22.447" end="01:22.619">the </span><span begin="01:22.619" end="01:23.356">skies </span><span begin="01:23.356" end="01:23.557">are </span><span begin="01:23.557" end="01:24.200">blue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.184" end="01:28.584"><span begin="01:26.184" end="01:26.421">When </span><span begin="01:26.421" end="01:26.648">it's </span><span begin="01:26.648" end="01:27.247">me </span><span begin="01:27.247" end="01:27.829">and </span><span begin="01:27.829" end="01:28.584">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.802" end="01:33.941"><span begin="01:32.802" end="01:33.029">Ba-</span><span begin="01:33.029" end="01:33.941">ba</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.247" end="01:39.647"><span begin="01:37.247" end="01:37.554">Ba-</span><span begin="01:37.554" end="01:38.349">ba </span><span begin="01:38.349" end="01:38.664">duh-</span><span begin="01:38.664" end="01:39.004">duh-</span><span begin="01:39.004" end="01:39.647">duh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.260" end="01:45.380"><span begin="01:40.260" end="01:40.489">Duh-</span><span begin="01:40.489" end="01:41.527">duh </span><span begin="01:42.409" end="01:44.298">ba </span><span begin="01:44.353" end="01:44.756">ba-</span><span begin="01:44.756" end="01:45.380">ba</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.057" end="01:47.835"><span begin="01:46.057" end="01:46.262">It </span><span begin="01:46.262" end="01:46.631">was </span><span begin="01:46.631" end="01:47.056">hard </span><span begin="01:47.056" end="01:47.245">to </span><span begin="01:47.245" end="01:47.835">blame</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.133" end="01:51.763"><span begin="01:49.133" end="01:49.285">'Cause </span><span begin="01:49.285" end="01:49.464">I </span><span begin="01:49.464" end="01:49.793">tend </span><span begin="01:49.793" end="01:50.369">to </span><span begin="01:50.369" end="01:51.763">isolate</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.902" end="01:55.189"><span begin="01:52.902" end="01:53.288">Playing </span><span begin="01:53.288" end="01:53.557">all </span><span begin="01:53.557" end="01:53.782">these </span><span begin="01:53.782" end="01:54.616">silly </span><span begin="01:54.616" end="01:55.189">games</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.586" end="01:58.079"><span begin="01:55.586" end="01:55.778">I </span><span begin="01:55.778" end="01:55.955">guess </span><span begin="01:55.955" end="01:56.175">I </span><span begin="01:56.175" end="01:56.411">wasn't </span><span begin="01:56.411" end="01:56.891">cut </span><span begin="01:56.891" end="01:57.081">out </span><span begin="01:57.081" end="01:57.378">for </span><span begin="01:57.378" end="01:58.079">lovе</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.180" end="02:03.160"><span begin="02:00.180" end="02:00.375">'Cause </span><span begin="02:00.375" end="02:00.588">love </span><span begin="02:00.588" end="02:00.809">is </span><span begin="02:00.809" end="02:01.597">always </span><span begin="02:01.597" end="02:01.950">ill-</span><span begin="02:01.950" end="02:03.160">advised</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.065" end="02:07.384"><span begin="02:04.065" end="02:04.508">Never </span><span begin="02:04.508" end="02:05.339">really </span><span begin="02:05.339" end="02:05.653">worked </span><span begin="02:05.653" end="02:05.922">my </span><span begin="02:05.922" end="02:06.456">way </span><span begin="02:06.456" end="02:07.384">before</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.803" end="02:10.344"><span begin="02:07.803" end="02:08.368">Spending </span><s