="02:27.930" end="02:28.644">much?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.362" end="02:32.579"><span begin="02:30.362" end="02:30.565">But </span><span begin="02:30.565" end="02:30.770">when </span><span begin="02:30.770" end="02:31.021">you </span><span begin="02:31.021" end="02:31.800">walked </span><span begin="02:31.800" end="02:32.579">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.156" end="02:37.455"><span begin="02:34.156" end="02:34.359">There </span><span begin="02:34.359" end="02:34.523">were </span><span begin="02:34.523" end="02:34.854">no </span><span begin="02:34.854" end="02:35.305">more </span><span begin="02:35.305" end="02:35.909">cloudy </span><span begin="02:35.909" end="02:37.455">days</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.455" end="02:39.733"><span begin="02:37.455" end="02:37.634">I </span><span begin="02:37.634" end="02:37.818">feel </span><span begin="02:37.818" end="02:38.032">it </span><span begin="02:38.032" end="02:38.198">in </span><span begin="02:38.198" end="02:38.948">my </span><span begin="02:38.948" end="02:39.733">skin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.466" end="02:44.195"><span begin="02:41.466" end="02:41.694">I'm </span><span begin="02:41.694" end="02:41.930">guessin' </span><span begin="02:41.930" end="02:42.141">that </span><span begin="02:42.141" end="02:42.725">you </span><span begin="02:42.725" end="02:43.224">found </span><span begin="02:43.224" end="02:43.569">your </span><span begin="02:43.569" end="02:44.195">way?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.613" end="02:48.531"><span begin="02:45.613" end="02:45.812">Oh </span><span begin="02:45.812" end="02:46.029">you </span><span begin="02:46.029" end="02:46.855">hit </span><span begin="02:46.855" end="02:47.138">me </span><span begin="02:47.138" end="02:47.626">like </span><span begin="02:47.626" end="02:47.840">a </span><span begin="02:47.840" end="02:48.531">truck</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.303" end="02:54.395"><span begin="02:49.303" end="02